#     of battle_server_rodata);
#   * 66d4 picks one setup sub-proc into the slot M+0x450 {fn, state, arg, ?}: local battles 6aac (rule 0) / 6c5c (rule 1) /
#     6dd0 (rule 1 + setup->0x22) / 7050 (rule 2) / 71d4 (rule 3), comm battles 734c / 73c4 / 7518 / 7488 (state machines over the
#     server2 sub-procs of the tables 0x021EFD00 / 0x021EFD1C / 0x021EFD38 / 0x021EFD54: 7 words {0, 75a9, 7759, 7969, 7bb1, X, 835d});
